            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "The development lead of the TypeScript team at Microsoft, [Ryan Cavanaugh](https://github.com/RyanCavanaugh), said the following in response to [my question](https://github.com/microsoft/typescript-go/discussions/4576):\n\n> `tsgo` as a name is effectively gone. This codebase [`typescript-go`] will migrate back into the `microsoft/TypeScript` repo in the coming weeks so that we can return to having a unified issue backlog.\n\nEven if `tsc --lsp --stdio` is not perfect yet, it seems to me that the Microsoft developers intend users to stop using `tsgo --lsp --stdio` in favour of `tsc --lsp --stdio` (or another LSP alternative).",
