        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "> is that because people don't want to wait until 7.0 is out of beta, or something?\n\nKind of. What is the alternative? Supporting both `tsc` and `tsgo` commands inside `tsgo.lua`? Straight out dropping support for the `tsgo` command, while keeping the `tsgo` config name?\n\n> and there are already too many variants of ts/js configs\n\nWhile that's true, I find the alternatives more confusing. If supporting both commands is preferred, that's fine by me.",
